Description: Sylpheed, the GTK 2 mail client, built on Qt
 Sylpheed is a lightweight, fast e-mail client with an MH mailbox, POP3,
 IMAP4 and SMTP (over TLS), filtering, junk mail control and an address
 book. This package builds its unmodified GTK 2 source against GTK made
 Qt: it runs as a Qt application without GTK.
 .
 The headers for Sylpheed plugins are included.
